    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Floor area Approx. 100 sqm/1076 sqft\n\nFlynn & Associates are delighted to present number 17 Discovery Building to the market. This impressive three bedroom penthouse apartment in The Discovery Building, Dublin 15, offers a superb combination of generous proportions, modern finishes and an enviable south west facing balcony. Ideally suited to those seeking spacious city living, the property boasts high bedroom ceilings, built in sliding door wardrobes, and excellent storage throughout. \n\nThe welcoming entrance hall features laminate wood flooring, recessed lighting and an intercom system, while the dining area is finished with laminate wood flooring and benefits from double doors opening onto the balcony, creating an ideal space for entertaining or enjoying the afternoon and evening sun. \n\nThe modern kitchen features tiled flooring and practical storage. The main bedroom benefits from a private ensuite & double doors leading to the balcony. The main bathroom is fully tiled and includes a shower, sink, toilet, and large mirror. The property also benefits from a utility & a storage room along with a private underground parking space, making this a fantastic opportunity to acquire a spacious and highly desirable penthouse apartment in Dublin 15.\n\nRoyal Canal Court is wonderful location just minutes walk from Rathborne Village which provides easy access to shops, restaurants, bus routes and train station. There are many further amenities on your door step such as the Royal Canal where you can enjoy beautiful scenic walks, gym, spar, creche and located close to the Phoenix Park, M50 motorway and Dublin City Centre. Viewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hallway - 13.2m (43'4\") x 2.75m (9'0\")\nwith laminate wood floor, intercom phone & recessed lighting.\n\nKitchen - 2.63m (8'8\") x 1.78m (5'10\")\nwith a range of modern floor & eye level fitted press units. Integrated fridge freezer, dishwasher, double oven, electric hob & extractor fan.\n\nDining Area - 4.11m (13'6\") x 2.06m (6'9\")\nwith laminate wood flooring.\n\nLiving Room - 4.1m (13'5\") x 2.06m (6'9\")\nwith laminate wood flooring & double doors leading to the large south west facing balcony.\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.13m (13'7\") x 3.15m (10'4\")\nwith carpet, built in wardrobes, ensuite & double doors leading to balcony.\n\nEnsuite - 1.27m (4'2\") x 2.22m (7'3\")\nwith w.c., w.h.b. & shower.Tiled floor & partially tiled walls.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.46m (11'4\") x 2.89m (9'6\")\nwith carpet flooring. Built in wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.86m (9'5\") x 3.12m (10'3\")\nwith carpet & built in wardrobes.\n\nMain Bathroom - 1.85m (6'1\") x 2.11m (6'11\")\nwith w.c., w.h.b., & bath with shower attachment. Fully tiled.\n\nLaundry Room - 1.85m (6'1\") x 1.86m (6'1\")\nAmple storage space. Plumbed for washing machine."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Three bedroom penthouse </li><li> Designated underground car parking space </li><li> On site gym facilities </li><li> Intercom Access </li><li> Built in Wardrobes </li><li> Lift Access </li><li> High ceiling throughout </li><li> Two minute walk to the newly opened Pelletstown Train station</li></ul>"
      },
